  "instruction": "Complete the task using command-line or batch-capable tools from Altium Designer, OrCAD Capture, or OpenSCAD. The neutral PCB package `fulladd.ipc2581` and `placement_rules.json` are on the desktop. Place the board and save the result. Requirements: - Write `fulladd_placed.ipc2581` and `placement.csv`. - `placement.csv` must list `Reference,X_mm,Y_mm,Side,Rotation` for every placed component. - The placed IPC-2581 file must preserve the original nets and layers. [Software] Altium Designer is available at `D:\\Altium\\AD26\\X2.EXE`. OrCAD Capture is available at `D:\\orcad\\tools\\bin\\Capture.exe`. OpenSCAD is available as `openscad`.",
